MANUAL_ONLY=true
TITLE=E2E-70: MCP — get_review_status and the conventions resource
TAGS=mcp
MODE=mcp
BODY=Poll get_review_status for a reviewed fixture PR and confirm it returns the latest row, that prNumber<1 or a missing repo yields -32602, that an unreviewed PR returns an empty result rather than an error, and that mergewatch://conventions/{owner}/{repo} serves the resolved conventions markdown following the documented discovery order. No fixture PR.
